<DocsExample TExample="SliderBasicExample" Title="Binding a value" Description="Min, Max and Step define the range. ShowValueIndicator displays the value while dragging." />
<DocsExample TExample="SliderStopsExample" Title="Stops and centered variant" Description="ShowStops with StopCount draws tick marks. The Centered variant fills from the middle, suited to offsets." />
<DocsExample TExample="SliderSizesExample" Title="Sizes and inset icon" Description="Size scales the track. InsetIcon appears inside the track on Medium and larger horizontal standard sliders." />
<DocsExample TExample="SliderVerticalExample" Title="Vertical orientation" Description="Orientation turns the slider vertical. Give it a container with some height. BindOnInput false updates the value only when released." />
<DocsExample TExample="SliderStatesExample" Title="Decimals, callbacks and states" Description="TNumber can be any numeric type. BindAfter runs after each change; Disabled and ReadOnly lock the value." />
